{"publicId":"6650e400-8e97-4e2e-aa59-5acf08e6a146","title":"Merck终止BTK抑制剂MK-1026开发，原因为中期临床未达终点","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T11:43:38.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T11:43:38.000Z","digest":"默克（Merck）于2026年11月18日宣布终止BTK抑制剂MK-1026的开发。该药物在中期临床试验中未能达到预设的肿瘤缓解率终点【新】。MK-1026原属ArQule公司，默克于2019年以27亿美元收购ArQule以获取该资产开发权。目前未披露后续处理计划，但终止开发可能影响默克在血液肿瘤领域的管线布局。\n\n默克2019年收购ArQule的核心目的是获得MK-1026的开发权，该化合物当时被视为潜在治疗B细胞恶性肿瘤的候选药物。此次终止开发系基于中期临床试验数据，但未公开具体未达终点的指标数值或样本量信息。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T13:18:41.952Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Merck 停止开发从 ArQule 获得的 BTK 抑制剂","latestReport":{"id":"ej4udjd6r8dgvjsddwlbuyw2f"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fsDiJNKb3OkI","title":"Merck ends development of BTK inhibitor MK-1026","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T11:43:38.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ej4udjd6r8dgvjsddwlbuyw2f","title":"Merck 停止开发从 ArQule 获得的 BTK 抑制剂","summary":"Merck 终止了开发 Nemtabrutinib（MK-1026），这是其 2019 年以 27 亿美元收购 ArQule 的主要原因。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:43:38.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ej4udjd6r8dgvjsddwlbuyw2f","title":"Merck 停止开发从 ArQule 获得的 BTK 抑制剂","summary":"Merck 终止了开发 Nemtabrutinib（MK-1026），这是其 2019 年以 27 亿美元收购 ArQule 的主要原因。","source":{"name":"Endpoints News","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:43:38.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-18T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T16:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-18T20:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"202